<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Instructions</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Press+Start+2P" rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body>
  <h1 id="level1-title"> Simon Game!</h1>
  <div id="level3-title">
    <ol>
      <p>Instructions:</p>
      <li>Press any key to begin the game.</li>
      <li>Watch the sequence of colors shown by the game.</li>
      <li>Repeat the sequence by clicking the colored buttons in the correct order.</li>
      <li>Each correct round adds a new color to the sequence.</li>
      <li>The game ends when you click the wrong color.</li>
      <li>Press any key again to restart and try to beat your previous level.</li>
    </ol>
    <br><br>
    <div class="center">
      <form action="/game" method="POST">
        <button type="submit" class="start_btn">Start Game!</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>